<title>USA: New England Business Service Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>New England Business Service Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>GROTON, Mass. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands of Dollars)</p>
<p>					   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Sep 28, 1996	 Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			   60,702		 63,788</p>
<p> Cost and Expenses		 59,555		 62,922</p>
<p> Income Before taxes		1,147		    866</p>
<p> Income Taxes			   469		    325</p>
<p> Net income (a)			 678		    541</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		 $0.05		  $0.04</p>
<p>NOTES: Net income for the first quarter 1996 includes after tax charge of $0.21 per share for the discontinuation of Kinko's retail initiative and other costs. Net for 1995 first quarter includes $0.34 per share after-tax charges and expense for a cost reduction program that included a plant consolidation.</p>
<p>Full company name is New England Service Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
